        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9a17f471403a0d37c4a3",
          "document_start": 239,
          "document_end": 297,
          "text": "在方块图中用变量和传递函数来计算输出变量，而在键合图理论中则是通过利用原因变量和键合图元件的特性方程来计算结果变量。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 239,
          "end": 297,
          "chunk_start": 239,
          "chunk_end": 297,
          "sentence_document_start": 239,
          "sentence_document_end": 297,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e4c78071ac9e318d6209",
          "document_start": 297,
          "document_end": 333,
          "text": "因此对键合图模型中每根键因果关系的确定，实质是就是确定该键两个广义状态变",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 297,
          "end": 333,
          "chunk_start": 297,
          "chunk_end": 333,
          "sentence_document_start": 297,
          "sentence_document_end": 333,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_106ff5143cdb9a12a637",
          "document_start": 335,
          "document_end": 355,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 335,
          "end": 355,
          "chunk_start": 335,
          "chunk_end": 355,
          "sentence_document_start": 335,
          "sentence_document_end": 355,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_58ef1481a6c1f16b840d",
          "document_start": 356,
          "document_end": 365,
          "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 356,
          "end": 365,
          "chunk_start": 356,
          "chunk_end": 365,
          "sentence_document_start": 356,
          "sentence_document_end": 365,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8798dcfd1d620b9244b4",
          "document_start": 366,
          "document_end": 398,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 366,
          "end": 398,
          "chunk_start": 366,
          "chunk_end": 398,
          "sentence_document_start": 366,
          "sentence_document_end": 398,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e12238e90827939ef1cb",
          "document_start": 400,
          "document_end": 417,
          "text": "量谁是因变量, 谁是果变量的问题。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 400,
          "end": 417,
          "chunk_start": 400,
          "chunk_end": 417,
          "sentence_document_start": 400,
          "sentence_document_end": 417,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_79c67a969139b9d82024",
          "document_start": 417,
          "document_end": 497,
          "text": "对整个模型来讲, 因果关系受制于系统构成的元件、元件间的连接方式以及系统的输入和输出关系等, 整个模型因果关系的确定就展示了系统的主因在系统内的传递过程和效果。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 417,
          "end": 497,
          "chunk_start": 417,
          "chunk_end": 497,
          "sentence_document_start": 417,
          "sentence_document_end": 497,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_dd79dd700e71c65c4ccc",
          "document_start": 497,
          "document_end": 601,
          "text": "所以通过对键合图模型因果关系的确定, 可以避免在推导系统动力学方程过程中由于盲目的变量代换而造成的麻烦和错乱, 同时也能很方便地检测系统模型的正确性, 在解系统动力学方程之前就可直观地了解到系统的一系列性质。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 497,
          "end": 601,
          "chunk_start": 497,
          "chunk_end": 601,
          "sentence_document_start": 497,
          "sentence_document_end": 601,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_dd97e2c1fd5b67f8fe90",
          "document_start": 603,
          "document_end": 623,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 603,
          "end": 623,
          "chunk_start": 603,
          "chunk_end": 623,
          "sentence_document_start": 603,
          "sentence_document_end": 623,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_3aab6e26bbec63f1f2b0",
          "document_start": 624,
          "document_end": 639,
          "text": "# 5.1.2 键和键合空间;",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 624,
          "end": 639,
          "chunk_start": 624,
          "chunk_end": 639,
          "sentence_document_start": 624,
          "sentence_document_end": 639,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9b5d927b46fcc9e94579",
          "document_start": 640,
          "document_end": 672,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 640,
          "end": 672,
          "chunk_start": 640,
          "chunk_end": 672,
          "sentence_document_start": 640,
          "sentence_document_end": 672,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_bdac898a629e83bfab9f",
          "document_start": 674,
          "document_end": 919,
          "text": "单纯从概念来看，不同能量范畴系统中的元件是千差万别的，如机械系统通常有杠杆、齿轮、链条、凸轮、皮带轮以及弹簧、电机等，而电子系统有电阻、二极管、三极管、电容、线圈、导线和电源等，液压系统有各种液压控制阀、流量控制阀、液压缸、液压泵和各种管路等，但是只要对各种能量范畴的系统中的元件和元件实现系统功能的组合方式进行仔细的分析，就可以找到它们之间还是存在许多共同点的，其中最根本的是：不管系统构成如何不同，元件的数量和性质差别如何大，系统的功能归根结底是通过能量在系统各元件的传递和转换来实现。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 674,
          "end": 919,
          "chunk_start": 674,
          "chunk_end": 919,
          "sentence_document_start": 674,
          "sentence_document_end": 919,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6a1c7f35d7c03f46a04d",
          "document_start": 919,
          "document_end": 950,
          "text": "因此只要抓住能量传递和转换的过程，就可以对系统进行有效的分析。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 919,
          "end": 950,
          "chunk_start": 919,
          "chunk_end": 950,
          "sentence_document_start": 919,
          "sentence_document_end": 950,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a24295a3357f70cb43a0",
          "document_start": 950,
          "document_end": 1009,
          "text": "一般而言，系统能量的传递和转换是随时间的变化而变化的，为了便于考虑能量与时间的关系，以瞬时功率来表示能量的传递和转换。",
          "section_id": "section_02a53dc3dad5",
          "start": 950,
          "end": 1009,
          "chunk_start": 950,
          "chunk_end": 1009,
          "sentence_document_start": 950,
          "sentence_document_end": 1009,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
